<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Using attributes during inference.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For inference, we follow the same scoring as per Eq. <a href="#A1.E9" title="Equation 9 ‣ Using attributes during training. ‣ A.1 Attribute generation and usage ‣ Appendix A Additional implementation details ‣ FedMVP: Federated Multi-modal Visual Prompt Tuning for Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>. The predicted class is given by taking an argmax of the probability distribution over all the classes. Since we utilize the scoring method of DESC in our method, we also compare the performance of DESC with FedMVP on two generalization settings – base-to-new generalization and multi-source single-target generalization – in Tab. <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Using attributes during training. ‣ A.1 Attribute generation and usage ‣ Appendix A Additional implementation details ‣ FedMVP: Federated Multi-modal Visual Prompt Tuning for Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>. From DESC numbers we can observe that using LLM-generated attributes alone is not sufficient to improve much over the ZS-CLIP baseline. Interestingly, DESC leads to a drop in performance over the ZS-CLIP baseline that does not use any attributes on the DomainBed benchmark. Contrarily, our FedMVP can better utilize the LLM attributes through the cross-attention mechanism of the proposed PromptFormer network, as described in Sec. 3.3.1 of the main paper.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Federated Multimodal Visual Prompt Tuning (FedMVP) algorithm</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algx1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="algx1.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">procedure</span> <span id="algx1.l1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Server Execution</span>

</div>
<div id="algx1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
                
                
                <math id="algx1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho^{0}=\{\Theta^{0}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho^{0}=\{\Theta^{0}\}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="algx1.l2.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx1.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Initialize <math id="algx1.l2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho^{0}</annotation></semantics></math> parameters of PromptFormer module
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
                
                
                <span id="algx1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="algx1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="algx1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> 0 <span id="algx1.l3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">to</span> <math id="algx1.l3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx1.l3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
<span id="algx1.l3.6" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx1.l3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> For total communication rounds <math id="algx1.l3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
                
                
                 Choose a random subset of remote clients as <math id="algx1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{r}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
                
                
                 <span id="algx1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>  <math id="algx1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="algx1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∈</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="algx1.l5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{r}</annotation></semantics></math> in parallel <span id="algx1.l5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
<span id="algx1.l5.5" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx1.l5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> For a client <math id="algx1.l5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>, belongs to <math id="algx1.l5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{r}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
                
                
                   Send the current global model <math id="algx1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho^{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>r</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho^{r}</annotation></semantics></math> to client <math id="algx1.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
                
                
                   Receive locally updated <math id="algx1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho^{r+1}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho^{r+1}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> from <span id="algx1.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Client Training</span>

</div>
<div id="algx1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
                
                
                 <span id="algx1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="algx1.l8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
                
                
                 Aggregate the updated model parameters, <math id="algx1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho^{r+1}=\frac{1}{|S_{r}|}\sum_{i\in S_{r}}\rho^{r+1}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho^{r+1}=\frac{1}{|S_{r}|}\sum_{i\in S_{r}}\rho^{r+1}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
                
                
                <span id="algx1.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="algx1.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
                
                
                Get the final model parameter <math id="algx1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho^{R}=\{\Theta^{R},\theta^{R}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>R</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Θ</mi><mi>R</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>θ</mi><mi>R</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho^{R}=\{\Theta^{R},\theta^{R}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="algx1.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="algx1.l12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">procedure</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="algx1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">procedure</span> <span id="algx1.l13.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Client Training</span>

</div>
<div id="algx1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
                
                
                Generate the attributes of set of classes, <math id="algx1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{i}=\{c_{i,k}\}^{K_{i}}_{k=1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{i}=\{c_{i,k}\}^{K_{i}}_{k=1}</annotation></semantics></math>, by a LLM
<span id="algx1.l14.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx1.l14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="algx1.l14.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is the total number of classes of <math id="algx1.l14.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
                
                
                Extract the attribute embeddings, <math id="algx1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathrm{A}}_{i}=\{\mathcal{E}_{t}(\texttt{LLM}(\mathcal{C}_{i}))\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐀</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">LLM</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathrm{A}}_{i}=\{\mathcal{E}_{t}(\texttt{LLM}(\mathcal{C}_{i}))\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
