                   Concatenate the [<span id="algx1.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">CLS</span>] token, the patch embeddings, and the visual prompts, as <math id="algx1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathrm{I}}=[\bm{\mathrm{z}};\bm{\mathrm{E}};\bm{\mathrm{P}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐈</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>𝐏</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathrm{I}}=[\bm{\mathrm{z}};\bm{\mathrm{E}};\bm{\mathrm{P}}]</annotation></semantics></math>

