<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T14.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 14</span>: </span><span id="A2.T14.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison of methods on the Single-source Multi-target (SSMT) Domain Generalization setting<span id="A2.T14.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. The results are reported for the OfficeHome dataset. Here Ar, Cl, Pr, Rw denote to Art, Clipart, Product and RealWorld domains respectively.</span></span></figcaption>
