<figure id="A2.T16" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T16.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 16</span>: </span><span id="A2.T16.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison of methods on the Single-source Multi-target (SSMT) Domain Generalization setting<span id="A2.T16.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. The results are reported for the Terra Incognita dataset. Here L38, L43, L46, L100 denote to Location-38, Location-43, Location-46 and Location-100 domains respectively.</span></span></figcaption>
<div id="A2.T16.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:501.0pt;height:94.9pt;vertical-align:-45.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-134.9pt,25.6pt) scale(0.7,0.7) ;">
